      "message": "Merge 8054397b0 (the maintainer's unit fix) into issue/885-rotary-feed-cap\n\nBoth sides fixed the inch feed word. Kept this branch's rotaryFeedWord\n(in/min floored to 0.001, so the under-0.1 mm/min refusal is the only\none and the same in both units) and the posted-length step; kept the\nmaintainer's pin a_capped_rotary_feed_is_posted_in_the_programs_unit,\nits band widened by 0.1 % for the posted length (1 mm of Z posts as\n0.0394 in = 1.00076 mm).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
